{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 202 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E18", "D6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the metronidazole shortage on 2022-01-13 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E39", "D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Baxter Healthcare Corporation plant at FEI 1416980 was classified OAI on 2026-04-02, which is 202 days before the 2026-10-21 posting.",
      "cites": ["E18", "D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to that plant on 2026-09-29.",
      "cites": ["E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second Baxter plant at FEI 2618677 has a history of OAI classifications in 2010, 2013, 2014, 2015, and 2016, with the most recent inspection VAI on 2024-07-19.",
      "cites": ["E21", "E24", "E26", "E28", "E29", "E31"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gland Pharma Limited and InfoRLife SA (labeler Hospira Inc.) are also listed as current shortages.",
      "cites": ["E37", "E38"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 9.6 days of the 500 mg/100 mL solution on hand and Corvale General has 21.7 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to transfer 64 units from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would give Corvale East 14 days and leave Corvale General with 18 days.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    }
  ]
}
